{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/2168651/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第6レーン\n齋藤飛鳥 川村真洋 中元日芽香 高山一実"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅー\nろってぃー\nかずみさーん\nありがとーうー＼(^ω^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさんも\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのせとりー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか\n涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\n音が出ないギター\nせっかちなかたつむり\n走れ！bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーことで\n久々の名古屋全握参加！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり全握いいね(^^)\nライブやって、グループで握手やって\nなんか１日が濃ゆい気がする＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、同じ会場で\n握手会をしてたSKE48から\n松井珠理奈さん、松井玲奈さん、\n高柳明音さんが乃木坂のブースに\n遊びにきてくださいました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影ナレありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/22/2168651/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみいわく、今日のひめたんは\nきゅるるーんってかおしてたんだって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅるるーんっ＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は大阪個握！\nホテルは誰とペアかなーわくわく。\n行くぜって方はよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服、私服ー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}